5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I worry about the people. Who actually knows the system, and who is leaving?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"The yard is the real test. If the equipment can't talk to the new system, we're stuck.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see the true cost. Headline prices hide the recurring bills that arrive later.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm concerned about ownership. When things break, who is actually in charge?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect our systems age quietly. I want to see what happens when we try to upgrade.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, cost is vital, but if the admins leave, the system is just paper.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, exactly. Last winter, nobody owned the outage. We need clear support lines.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Misaki, agreed. But I need to verify if the operating lines are the real trap.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, I agree. I want to check the support ownership during that outage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, I will look at the upgrade history. We skipped windows before; why?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors' routines.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll look at the yard devices and the depot calendar. We can't freeze in winter.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the board minutes and the five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will review the support ownership and the warehouse rule changes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the upgrade history and the data lift from the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's see who is actually holding the knowledge together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope the yard equipment isn't too old to save.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The data will show where the money really goes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I want to know if we are walking into the same mess again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic over hope. Let's see what the past tells us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
